(q)
"Bottling line" means any system consisting of all or a subset of the following processes-cleaning, washing, rinsing,
filling, sealing, labeling and packaging etc. of bottles leading to bottling of country liquor as prescribed under these rules;
(r)
"Prescribed" means prescribed by these rules;
(s)
"Unit" means either a capsuled or labeled bottle containing country liquor or a sealed or labeled bottle containing country
liquor.

